  "details": "Impostors currently cache on the machine when updating them, this is problematic when trying to debug or test avatar impostors, as the impostor will not actually update in-game until you clear your cache and restart.\n\nAlso, it is not possible to “Re-Generate” impostors. You must delete the old impostor and then generate a new one. The website says that you should be able to re-generate them but it does not work, and there isnt a way to generate impostors without first removing the existing ones.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\n1. Impostors are refreshed and reset when updated, similarly to the actual avatar itself, how switching back into it or re-loading it causes the avatar to update in the client.\n\n2. The “Generate” button on the website allowing to “Re-Generate” impostors when the avatar already has them.",
